              "prompt": "Bellow is summaries of partial meeting transcripts, write the final summary, and include any final decisions and action points made and summarise the topics talked about. Include base meeting information, and participants if possible. The final summary should not contain too many words that would repeat over different meetings.\n\n\n\"{text}\"\n\n\nCONCISE SUMMARY (Do not say anything additional, simply respond with only the summary):"
            }
